24
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:01,560
There are so many mortals here,

25
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:03,720
they should be brimming with life.

26
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:07,380
So why is this death aura so prevalent ?

27
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,520
For a year,

28
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:18,920
I travelled through many cities all over Xue Yue.

29
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:21,720
There are no royal families here.

30
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:24,000
Instead,

31
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:26,880
every city belongs to a powerful cultivator.

32
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,160
Here,

33
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,840
the mortals are slaves.

34
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:35,460
The only meaning to their life

35
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:38,140
is to carve ice sculptures for cultivators

36
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:40,680
in order to make a living.
